@startuml
title Work Line Take Over - High Level View

box "Gaining Provider" #E0E0E0
  participant "BuyerGW" as BGW1
end box
box "Losing Provider" #E0E0E0
  participant "BuyerGW" as BGW2
end box
box "Wholeseller" #E0E0E0
  participant "SellerGW" as SellerGW
  participant "Geographic Location\n(TMF679)" as GeoLocation #E5DCF0
  participant "Product Offering Qualification\n(TMF679)" as POQ #E5DCF0
  participant "Appointment Management\n(TMF646)" as Appointment #E5DCF0
  participant "Product Order Management\n(TMF622)" as ProductOrderMgt #E5DCF0
end box

== Location Qualification (TMF679) ==

BGW1 -> GeoLocation : 1 GET /geographicAddress\nUsing UPRN to match the address
GeoLocation --> BGW1 : 2 Response: address/candidateAddress\nSeller validates the address
BGW1 -> POQ : 3 POST /productOfferingQualification\nQuery available products for location
POQ --> BGW1 : 4 Response: eligible products\n+ flags whether appointment is required

== Appointment (If Required) ==

alt Appointment Required
    BGW1 -> Appointment : 5 POST /appointment\nBuyer creates appointment
    Appointment --> BGW1 : 6 Seller responds with appointment confirmation
end

note over BGW1, BGW2
  Buyer must submit the order only after
  appointment is confirmed OR
  appointment not required (Seller flag)
end note

== Switch Order Submission (Gaining Provider) ==

BGW1 -> ProductOrderMgt : 7 POST TMF622 /productOrder\n"Switch" Order
ProductOrderMgt --> BGW1 : 8 productOrderCreateEvent(acknowledged)\nSeller accepts the order

note over SellerGW, ProductOrderMgt
  Seller validates the order and the Losing Provider supports switching.
  Seller validates provided appointment details.
end note

== Seller Plan & Manage Switch Request ==

ProductOrderMgt -> SellerGW : 9 Seller creates "Cease Order"\non behalf of Losing Provider (BGW2)
SellerGW -> BGW2 : 10 Cease Request Notification
BGW2 -> SellerGW : 11 Send Cease "Pending" to Gaining Provider
BGW2 -> SellerGW : 12 Send Cease "In-Progress" to Gaining Provider
BGW2 -> SellerGW : 13 Send Cease "Acknowledged" to Gaining Provider
BGW2 -> SellerGW : 14 Send Cease "Committed" to Gaining Provider

... Wait for Switch Date ...

BGW2 -> SellerGW : 15 Send Cease "Completed" to Gaining Provider

== Service Activation (Gaining Provider) ==

SellerGW -> BGW1 : 16 Service Activated\nProvision Gaining Provider Service

== Completion Notification ==

SellerGW -> BGW1 : 17 productOrderStateChangeEvent(completed)

@enduml
